# An example score: forty minutes, written down.
#   <time>  <parameter>  <value>  [over <duration>]
# Times are m:ss or h:mm:ss. Without "over" the value is set at that moment; with it the
# parameter travels there from wherever it was, in its own perceptual curve.
# Render it offline:  ambient_render --preset "Sleep Concert" --score docs/example.score

0:00    brain_density 3
0:00    cosmos_send 0
0:00    room_level 0
0:00    far_decay 25
0:00    master_gain -14

4:00    brain_density 5 over 6:00
6:00    cosmos_send 0.45 over 8:00
8:00    far_decay 60 over 10:00

18:00   room_level 0.35 over 5:00
20:00   cosmos_shimmer 0.4 over 6:00
24:00   body_level 0.5 over 4:00

30:00   brain_density 3 over 6:00
32:00   cosmos_send 0.15 over 6:00
34:00   far_decay 90 over 6:00
36:00   master_gain -22 over 4:00
40:00   brain_on off
